# dungeons_and_dragons_pro 1.10 - PAD-420: one port per newest build, from this build's framework-generation draft and the same
# title's proven port, with other titles' feature lines taken out (docs/plans/pad420_mode_sweep.md).
# Emulator-proven 2026-10-07 by a build check (modes/gamecheck.sh play, the stock card, hidden, muted):
# the runtime hooked the game, 24 of its 26 shots came from their switches, a drain ended a ball,
# events seen firing: game_start, ball_start, ball_end, bonus_start, bonus_end, tilt_warning, tilt.
# Shots no press made: Left outlane, Right outlane.

